{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"1c1809dc5c0852a24fd2e98a16f1c48a0099bb5a8076dad64ee116379fb4b925","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天使和小書卷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又看見另有一位大力的天使從天降下，披着雲彩，頭上有虹，臉面像日頭，兩腳像火柱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他手裏拿着小書卷，是展開的。他右腳踏海，左腳踏地，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大聲呼喊，好像獅子吼叫。呼喊完了，就有七雷發聲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["七雷發聲之後，我正要寫出來，就聽見從天上有聲音說：「七雷所說的，你要封上，不可寫出來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我所看見的那踏海踏地的天使向天舉起右手來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["指着那創造天和天上之物，地和地上之物，海和海中之物，直活到永永遠遠的，起誓說：「不再有時日了",{"noteId":6},"。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但在第七位天使吹號發聲的時候，上帝的奧祕就成全了，正如上帝所傳給他僕人眾先知的佳音。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我先前從天上所聽見的那聲音又吩咐我說：「你去，把那踏海踏地之天使手中展開的小書卷取過來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我就走到天使那裏，對他說：「請你把小書卷給我。」他對我說：「你拿着吃盡了，便叫你肚子發苦，然而在你口中要甜如蜜。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我從天使手中把小書卷接過來，吃盡了，在我口中果然甜如蜜，吃了以後，肚子覺得發苦了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["天使",{"noteId":7},"對我說：「你必指着多民、多國、多方、多王再說預言。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：不再耽延了","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":6}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"原文是他們","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}